OPcache: compiled scripts kept in shared memory, so that PHP does
not compile them on each request. A Zend extension, loaded before
the others.

The module opcache of PHP 5.6 for php56 of azsupport/ports,
which installs side by side with the other versions of PHP:
lib/php/20131226/opcache.so, loaded by its ini in etc/php56/conf.d,
its headers in include/php56/php/ext/opcache.
